### REST Client — S8.5 IaC con Bicep.
### Comparativa + linter de .bicep + parser what-if.

@host = http://localhost:5109

### Salud
GET {{host}}/health

### Comparativa Bicep / ARM / Terraform (slide 3)
GET {{host}}/iac/comparativa

### Recomendar: solo Azure + sin Terraform → Bicep
POST {{host}}/iac/recomendar
Content-Type: application/json

{ "soloAzure": true }

### Recomendar: multi-cloud → Terraform
POST {{host}}/iac/recomendar
Content-Type: application/json

{ "multiCloud": true }

### Validar bicep OK (slide 6/11)
POST {{host}}/iac/validar
Content-Type: application/json

{ "bicep": "targetScope = 'resourceGroup'\n\n@secure()\nparam cosmosConnectionString string\n\nparam appName string = 'app-ventas'\n\nresource plan 'Microsoft.Web/serverfarms@2023-12-01' = {\n  name: 'plan-ventas'\n  location: resourceGroup().location\n  sku: { name: 'S1' }\n}\n" }

### Validar bicep con problemas: secreto literal + param sin @secure (slide 11)
POST {{host}}/iac/validar
Content-Type: application/json

{ "bicep": "param dbPassword string\nparam appName string\n\nvar connection = 'Server=tcp:sql.db;Password=p@ssword123;User=admin'\n\nresource a 'Microsoft.Web/sites@2023-12-01' = {\n  name: appName\n}\n\noutput connectionString string = connection\n" }

### Parsear what-if con Delete de Cosmos (riesgo alto, slide 14)
POST {{host}}/iac/whatif/parsear
Content-Type: application/json

{ "output": "Note: The result may contain false positives.\n\n  - /subscriptions/x/resourceGroups/rg-ventas/providers/Microsoft.DocumentDB/databaseAccounts/cosmos-ventas [Microsoft.DocumentDB/databaseAccounts]\n  + /subscriptions/x/resourceGroups/rg-ventas/providers/Microsoft.Web/sites/app-ventas [Microsoft.Web/sites]\n  ~ /subscriptions/x/resourceGroups/rg-ventas/providers/Microsoft.Web/serverfarms/plan-ventas [Microsoft.Web/serverfarms]\n  = /subscriptions/x/resourceGroups/rg-ventas/providers/Microsoft.Storage/storageAccounts/stventas [Microsoft.Storage/storageAccounts]\n" }

### Plan + checklist del entregable
POST {{host}}/iac/plan
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "escenario": { "soloAzure": true },
  "bicep": "targetScope = 'resourceGroup'\n@secure()\nparam connectionString string\n\nparam appName string\n\nresource a 'Microsoft.Web/sites@2023-12-01' = {\n  name: appName\n  location: resourceGroup().location\n}\n",
  "whatIfOutput": "+ resource1 [Microsoft.Web/sites]"
}
